   "description": "Konu panosu: sır bandı, ad, çini ızgarası.",
   "html": "<div class=\"ds-pano\"><b>Göl, Dağ, Ova ve Baraj</b><small>3/26 sırlı</small><div class=\"ds-tiles\"><i class=\"t2\"></i><i class=\"t2\"></i><i class=\"t1\"></i><i class=\"t3\"></i><i></i><i></i></div></div>",
   "css": ".ds-pano{width:150px;background:#f3f7fc;border-radius:6px;padding:15px 10px 10px;box-shadow:inset 0 7px 0 #1f8a4c,0 2px 0 rgba(14,31,85,.25),0 8px 18px -8px rgba(5,14,45,.55);font-family:Rubik,system-ui,sans-serif;color:#0e1f55}.ds-pano b{display:block;font-size:15px;font-weight:800}.ds-pano small{color:#3d4f86;font-weight:600;font-size:12.5px}.ds-tiles{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(6,1fr);gap:3px;margin-top:8px}.ds-tiles i{aspect-ratio:1;border-radius:2px;background:#e7d6bf;box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px #cdb79a}.ds-tiles i.t1{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#1f8a4c 0 22%,#fff 22% 78%,#1f8a4c 78%);box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px #1f8a4c}.ds-tiles i.t2{background:radial-gradient(circle at 30% 28%,rgba(255,255,255,.75) 0 12%,transparent 13%),#1f8a4c;box-shadow:none}.ds-tiles i.t3{background:linear-gradient(118deg,transparent 46%,#7a3b69 46% 54%,transparent 54%),#e7d6bf;box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px #7a3b69}"
  },
